From e84be58d0b032b451340853e36ca49fc49520f2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:26:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Convert site from YouTube-description mirror to hand-written
 blog

- Add Post model (title, excerpt, Markdown body authored in /admin; YouTube only embedded)
- Admin: posts list, editor with live publish checklist, draft/publish gate
- Public: /blog index, /blog/[slug] article with Article JSON-LD, topic hubs from posts
- Sitemap lists only published posts that pass quality checks; empty topic hubs noindex
- /video/* no longer renders YouTube content: 301 to matching post, else 404
- Remove site-wide canonical '/' from root layout
